{
  "139.csv::274": {
    "id": "139.csv::274",
    "source_text": "島へ渡る時は、準備ぬかりなく\n――いいな？",
    "translated_text": "When you cross to the island, see your preparations want for naught — aye?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:40:07.570470",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:40:07.571681",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 274,
    "speaker": "Joseph",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::275": {
    "id": "139.csv::275",
    "source_text": "黒騎士はその力がどれほどか\n計り知れぬほど恐ろしい相手です",
    "translated_text": "The Black Knight is a foe of unfathomable power.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:40:27.548908",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:40:27.550971",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 275,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::276": {
    "id": "139.csv::276",
    "source_text": "けれど、私を狙い、そのために人々を襲い\nあまつさえ大地を穢さんとする者を\n見過ごすわけにはいきません",
    "translated_text": "But I cannot overlook one who targets me, falls upon folk for that end, and would even befoul the land.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:40:53.132168",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:40:53.134577",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 276,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::277": {
    "id": "139.csv::277",
    "source_text": "隊長さん――",
    "translated_text": "Captain...",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:40:59.735008",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:40:59.737494",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 277,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::278": {
    "id": "139.csv::278",
    "source_text": "あなたが蘇らせてくれたおかげで\nわたしは自らの負う使命を\n取り戻すことができました",
    "translated_text": "Thanks to you reviving me, I&#x27;ve regained the mission I bear.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:41:21.451251",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:41:21.453655",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 278,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::279": {
    "id": "139.csv::279",
    "source_text": "もう、闇は恐れません",
    "translated_text": "I fear the dark no more.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:41:38.323878",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:41:38.326490",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 279,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::280": {
    "id": "139.csv::280",
    "source_text": "今度こそ黒騎士を倒すことができる――\nそう信じています",
    "translated_text": "This time, we can defeat the Black Knight — I believe so.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:41:50.888711",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:41:50.891089",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 280,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::281": {
    "id": "139.csv::281",
    "source_text": "調査隊駐屯地のベルトランから\n魔赤島の山頂部に通じる\n駐屯地内の扉を解放したと連絡が入った",
    "translated_text": "Word has come from Bertrand at the Expedition Garrison—the door within leading to Bloodbane Isle&#x27;s summit has been unlocked.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:42:08.234358",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:42:08.236865",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 281,
    "speaker": "Joseph",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::282": {
    "id": "139.csv::282",
    "source_text": "光り輝く歪みの場所へ向かうなら\nそこを通るのが一番だろう",
    "translated_text": "If you head for the place of shining distortion, &#x27;tis best you pass through there.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:42:25.773947",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:42:25.776633",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 282,
    "speaker": "Joseph",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::283": {
    "id": "139.csv::283",
    "source_text": "黒き騎士は異邦の力の使い手\n――あなどるなよ",
    "translated_text": "The Black Knight wieldeth a foreign power—underestimate him not.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:43:19.511670",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:43:19.514353",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 283,
    "speaker": "The White Dragon",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::284": {
    "id": "139.csv::284",
    "source_text": "俺はずっと自分の人生の主だった",
    "translated_text": "I&#x27;ve always been master of me own life.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:43:37.680561",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:43:37.683141",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 284,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::285": {
    "id": "139.csv::285",
    "source_text": "でもよ、面倒な判断を人任せにするのも\n悪くねえな",
    "translated_text": "But hey, leavin&#x27; the bothersome decidin&#x27; to others ain&#x27;t half bad, eh",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:44:17.801351",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:44:17.803967",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 285,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::286": {
    "id": "139.csv::286",
    "source_text": "さあ、行けよ\n付いていくぜ",
    "translated_text": "Right, off you go.\nI&#x27;ll follow along.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:44:47.973278",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:44:47.975980",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 286,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::287": {
    "id": "139.csv::287",
    "source_text": "問題を片づけたらフィンダム旅行かな？\n楽しみ～！",
    "translated_text": "Once we sort this out, a trip to Phindym, maybe? Can&#x27;t wait~!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:45:16.169836",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:45:16.172589",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 287,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::288": {
    "id": "139.csv::288",
    "source_text": "セシリーの面倒は俺が見ますから\n隊長は現地状況の見極め、よろしくです！",
    "translated_text": "I&#x27;ll look after Cecily, so Captain, I&#x27;m countin&#x27; on you to size up the situation on the ground!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:46:01.910190",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:46:01.912800",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 288,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::289": {
    "id": "139.csv::289",
    "source_text": "わたしはここで君たちの帰りを待つよ",
    "translated_text": "I shall wait here for your return.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:46:36.191982",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:46:36.194933",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 289,
    "speaker": "Loeg",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::290": {
    "id": "139.csv::290",
    "source_text": "一緒に行ったところで、足手まといになるのは\nわかっているからね",
    "translated_text": "Even were I to go with you, I know I&#x27;d be naught but a burden.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:47:14.496825",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:47:14.499559",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 290,
    "speaker": "Loeg",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::291": {
    "id": "139.csv::291",
    "source_text": "こういう時の留守番は本当に忸怩たる思いだよ\nでも、学究肌の宿命だね",
    "translated_text": "Holding the fort at a time like this is truly vexing, but such is a scholar&#x27;s lot, I suppose.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:48:29.415281",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:48:29.418175",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 291,
    "speaker": "Klaus",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::292": {
    "id": "139.csv::292",
    "source_text": "いよいよ黒騎士との決戦だな？",
    "translated_text": "At last, the decisive battle with the Black Knight, eh?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:48:48.181994",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:48:48.185241",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 292,
    "speaker": "Zerkin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::293": {
    "id": "139.csv::293",
    "source_text": "さあ、船ン中で、きっちり休んでくれ\nもっとも、すぐに到着させちまうけどよ",
    "translated_text": "Now then, get a proper rest aboard ship. Mind you, we&#x27;ll have you at port ere long.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:49:02.228385",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:49:02.231292",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 293,
    "speaker": "Zerkin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::294": {
    "id": "139.csv::294",
    "source_text": "この先の、奥の扉を解放してある――",
    "translated_text": "The inner door ahead has been unlocked—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:49:11.494505",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:49:11.497455",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 294,
    "speaker": "Bertrand",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::295": {
    "id": "139.csv::295",
    "source_text": "扉の先は魔赤島の山頂部\nあの忌まわしい赤い光のお膝元だ\n決して気を抜くなよ",
    "translated_text": "Beyond the door lies Bloodbane Isle&#x27;s summit — the very feet of that accursed red light. Do not let your guard down, ser.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:49:41.821252",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:49:41.824891",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 295,
    "speaker": "Bertrand",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::296": {
    "id": "139.csv::296",
    "source_text": "ガリュリュリュ！",
    "translated_text": "Graaagh!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:50:10.857592",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:50:10.860908",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 296,
    "speaker": "Altered Zuhl",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::297": {
    "id": "139.csv::297",
    "source_text": "キキキキキ――",
    "translated_text": "Kikikiki...",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:50:20.627682",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:50:20.631011",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 297,
    "speaker": "Altered Zuhl",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::298": {
    "id": "139.csv::298",
    "source_text": "グギギギギ――",
    "translated_text": "Grrrrrr—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:50:29.536334",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:50:29.539701",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 298,
    "speaker": "Altered Zuhl",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::299": {
    "id": "139.csv::299",
    "source_text": "く――ろ――き――キキキキ――",
    "translated_text": "Ku—ro—ki—Kikikiki—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:50:39.640772",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:50:39.644754",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 299,
    "speaker": "Altered Zuhl",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::300": {
    "id": "139.csv::300",
    "source_text": "ぢから――ぢからを――ぐで――",
    "translated_text": "Power—power—guh—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:51:12.689571",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:51:12.693163",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 300,
    "speaker": "Altered Zuhl",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::301": {
    "id": "139.csv::301",
    "source_text": "お――まーいーらーーー！",
    "translated_text": "Youuu— bastards—!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:51:34.098518",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:51:34.102286",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 301,
    "speaker": "Altered Zuhl",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::302": {
    "id": "139.csv::302",
    "source_text": "ギニュー――",
    "translated_text": "Gineu...",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:51:51.581543",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:51:51.585356",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 302,
    "speaker": "Altered Zuhl",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::303": {
    "id": "139.csv::303",
    "source_text": "ぶっころリュリュリュ――",
    "translated_text": "Kill kill gryaaaah—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:52:28.641453",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:52:28.645980",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 303,
    "speaker": "Altered Zuhl",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::304": {
    "id": "139.csv::304",
    "source_text": "オマイロアァァァ――",
    "translated_text": "Omairoaaaa—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:52:35.505871",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:52:35.509302",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 304,
    "speaker": "Altered Zuhl",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::305": {
    "id": "139.csv::305",
    "source_text": "ズール――狙いはセシリーひとり",
    "translated_text": "Zuhl — the target is Cecily alone.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:53:06.393285",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:53:06.397216",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 305,
    "speaker": "Black Knight",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::306": {
    "id": "139.csv::306",
    "source_text": "ズールよ！　もう、届かぬか――",
    "translated_text": "Zuhl! Can you reach no further—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:53:22.293503",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:53:22.297398",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 306,
    "speaker": "Black Knight",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::307": {
    "id": "139.csv::307",
    "source_text": "勝利など――夢と知るがいい――",
    "translated_text": "Victory—know &#x27;tis but a dream—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:53:38.243721",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:53:38.247703",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 307,
    "speaker": "Black Knight",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::308": {
    "id": "139.csv::308",
    "source_text": "覚者どもめ――こしゃくな",
    "translated_text": "Arisen—how insolent.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:53:56.974086",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:53:56.978061",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 308,
    "speaker": "Black Knight",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::309": {
    "id": "139.csv::309",
    "source_text": "半端覚者に手こずるな！",
    "translated_text": "Do not struggle against a half-baked Arisen!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:54:13.593721",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:54:13.597940",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 309,
    "speaker": "Black Knight",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::310": {
    "id": "139.csv::310",
    "source_text": "ズール！　聞こえぬか、ズール！",
    "translated_text": "Zuhl! Do you not hear, Zuhl!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:54:17.815787",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:54:17.819754",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 310,
    "speaker": "Black Knight",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::311": {
    "id": "139.csv::311",
    "source_text": "みなさん、よろしくお願いします",
    "translated_text": "Everyone, I&#x27;m counting on you.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:54:29.947711",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:54:29.951628",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 311,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::312": {
    "id": "139.csv::312",
    "source_text": "手強いけど、勝てます！",
    "translated_text": "&#x27;Tis a tough foe, but we can win!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:54:46.644640",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:54:46.648731",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 312,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::313": {
    "id": "139.csv::313",
    "source_text": "隊長、さすがです！",
    "translated_text": "Captain, &#x27;tis just as I expected!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:55:06.693765",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:55:06.697956",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 313,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::314": {
    "id": "139.csv::314",
    "source_text": "声をかけあって！",
    "translated_text": "Call out to one another!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:55:26.345189",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:55:26.349037",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 314,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::315": {
    "id": "139.csv::315",
    "source_text": "まだいけます！",
    "translated_text": "I can still fight!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:55:41.005949",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:55:41.009967",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 315,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::316": {
    "id": "139.csv::316",
    "source_text": "わたしが！",
    "translated_text": "Me!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:55:53.456072",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:55:53.460254",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 316,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::317": {
    "id": "139.csv::317",
    "source_text": "くっ――みなさん、大丈夫ですか！？",
    "translated_text": "Kh— Is everyone unharmed!?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:56:15.281950",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:56:15.286138",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 317,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::318": {
    "id": "139.csv::318",
    "source_text": "ここで倒れるわけにはいかない！",
    "translated_text": "I cannot fall here!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:56:36.134875",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:56:36.139095",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 318,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::319": {
    "id": "139.csv::319",
    "source_text": "ウィルミア――力を――！",
    "translated_text": "Willmia... power...!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:56:44.846427",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:56:44.850821",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 319,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::320": {
    "id": "139.csv::320",
    "source_text": "ふん、哀れなズールめ",
    "translated_text": "Hmph, that wretched Zuhl.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:56:59.386707",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:56:59.391034",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 320,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::321": {
    "id": "139.csv::321",
    "source_text": "オレが眠らせてやる",
    "translated_text": "I&#x27;ll put you down.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:58:31.405121",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:58:31.409551",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 321,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::322": {
    "id": "139.csv::322",
    "source_text": "おら！　どっか行け！",
    "translated_text": "Hoy! Get lost!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:58:56.179209",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:58:56.183849",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 322,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::323": {
    "id": "139.csv::323",
    "source_text": "ズール、目を覚ませ！",
    "translated_text": "Zuhl, wake up!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:59:04.829992",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:59:04.834627",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 323,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::324": {
    "id": "139.csv::324",
    "source_text": "隊長、生きてっか！？",
    "translated_text": "Captain, you alive!?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:59:30.423562",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:59:30.428385",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 324,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::325": {
    "id": "139.csv::325",
    "source_text": "俺は俺の勝利に賭けるぜ！",
    "translated_text": "I&#x27;ll wager on my own victory!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T15:59:48.122928",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T15:59:48.128174",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 325,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::326": {
    "id": "139.csv::326",
    "source_text": "前のズールが懐かしいよ",
    "translated_text": "I miss the old Zuhl.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:00:15.508433",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:00:15.513019",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 326,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::327": {
    "id": "139.csv::327",
    "source_text": "オマイ、おとなしくしな！",
    "translated_text": "Pipe down, you!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:00:38.801720",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:00:38.806549",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 327,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::328": {
    "id": "139.csv::328",
    "source_text": "黒騎士、出てこい！",
    "translated_text": "Black Knight, come out!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:00:54.026337",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:00:54.030896",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 328,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::329": {
    "id": "139.csv::329",
    "source_text": "嫌い、嫌い、嫌い！",
    "translated_text": "Hate it, hate it, hate it!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:01:05.728484",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:01:05.733367",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 329,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::330": {
    "id": "139.csv::330",
    "source_text": "さっさと終わらせましょう！",
    "translated_text": "Let&#x27;s get this over with quick!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:01:17.394827",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:01:17.399426",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 330,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::331": {
    "id": "139.csv::331",
    "source_text": "油断しちゃダメですよ！",
    "translated_text": "Don&#x27;t you go gettin&#x27; careless!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:01:44.128434",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:01:44.133204",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 331,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::332": {
    "id": "139.csv::332",
    "source_text": "余力残してください！",
    "translated_text": "Leave some in reserve!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:02:23.677689",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:02:23.682479",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 332,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::333": {
    "id": "139.csv::333",
    "source_text": "よく見て行きましょう！",
    "translated_text": "Let&#x27;s take a good look as we go!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:02:48.216059",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:02:48.220941",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 333,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::334": {
    "id": "139.csv::334",
    "source_text": "俺だってやってます！",
    "translated_text": "I&#x27;m doing it too!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:02:57.081664",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:02:57.086879",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 334,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::335": {
    "id": "139.csv::335",
    "source_text": "とどめだ！",
    "translated_text": "Finishing blow!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:03:15.497610",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:03:15.502615",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 335,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::336": {
    "id": "139.csv::336",
    "source_text": "黒騎士が消えればすべてが好転する――\n今はただ、そう祈るほかありません",
    "translated_text": "If the Black Knight vanishes, all will turn for the better — now, naught remains but prayer.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:03:58.389835",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:03:58.394965",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 336,
    "speaker": "Cecily",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::337": {
    "id": "139.csv::337",
    "source_text": "チッ――レオの奴、恰好つけやがって\nバカでかい借りができちまったようだな\nさっさと返してやろうぜ",
    "translated_text": "Tch — Leo, showin&#x27; off like that...\n&#x27;Tis a whoppin&#x27; great debt I&#x27;ve landed myself with.\nLet&#x27;s settle it quick.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:04:36.023509",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:04:36.028680",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 337,
    "speaker": "Gurdolin",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::338": {
    "id": "139.csv::338",
    "source_text": "レスタニアとフィンダムを繋ぐこの島は\n侵食魔の巣窟でもあります",
    "translated_text": "This island linking Lestania and Phindym... &#x27;tis also an Infected Den.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:05:10.466106",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:05:10.471404",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 338,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::339": {
    "id": "139.csv::339",
    "source_text": "最終的には――\nフィンダムから来る侵食魔を止めないと\n問題は解決しませんよね",
    "translated_text": "Ultimately—\nUnless we stop the Corruption Demons coming from Phindym,\nthe problem won&#x27;t be solved, right?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:05:20.033181",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:05:20.038914",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 339,
    "speaker": "Elliot",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::340": {
    "id": "139.csv::340",
    "source_text": "隊長、一度神殿に戻ろうよ",
    "translated_text": "Captain, let&#x27;s head back to the temple for a spell.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:05:30.921871",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:05:30.927189",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 340,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::341": {
    "id": "139.csv::341",
    "source_text": "この目で見たこと、この耳で聞いたこと――\nレオの最期の叫び――全部伝えないと",
    "translated_text": "What I saw with these eyes, what I heard with these ears—Leo&#x27;s final cry—I&#x27;ve got to tell it all.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:05:59.358810",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:05:59.364341",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 341,
    "speaker": "Lise",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::342": {
    "id": "139.csv::342",
    "source_text": "レオは――",
    "translated_text": "Leo...",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:06:22.450686",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:06:22.456565",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 342,
    "speaker": "Vanessa",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::343": {
    "id": "139.csv::343",
    "source_text": "ふん、変わった奴だった\n生涯、忘れることはないだろう",
    "translated_text": "Hmph. A strange one. Shan&#x27;t forget in all my days.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:06:37.604200",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:06:37.609778",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 343,
    "speaker": "Vanessa",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::344": {
    "id": "139.csv::344",
    "source_text": "レオ――",
    "translated_text": "Leo—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:06:46.443663",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:06:46.449204",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 344,
    "speaker": "Fabio",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::345": {
    "id": "139.csv::345",
    "source_text": "さっさと酔ってしまいたいが\nこんな時に限ってまったく酔えないんだ",
    "translated_text": "Want to get drunk quick, but &#x27;tis just my luck — can&#x27;t get drunk at a time like this.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:07:55.993828",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:07:56.002137",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 345,
    "speaker": "Fabio",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::346": {
    "id": "139.csv::346",
    "source_text": "レオのことは残念だったな\n気を落とすなよ",
    "translated_text": "&#x27;Tis a pity about Leo. Don&#x27;t lose heart.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:08:38.779741",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:08:38.786355",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 346,
    "speaker": "Heinz",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::347": {
    "id": "139.csv::347",
    "source_text": "レオとは、いつかまた会えるって思っていたのに――",
    "translated_text": "I thought I&#x27;d meet Leo again someday—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:09:03.320538",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:09:03.327053",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 347,
    "speaker": "Mayleaf",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::348": {
    "id": "139.csv::348",
    "source_text": "皆、レオのことを話しているが\n誰もわたしに話そうとしない\nまあ、察しは付くよ",
    "translated_text": "All speak of Leo, yet...\nNone will tell me aught.\nWell, &#x27;tis not hard to guess.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:09:33.476711",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:09:33.482349",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 348,
    "speaker": "Joseph",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::349": {
    "id": "139.csv::349",
    "source_text": "――おかえり\nレオのこと、聞いてるよ――",
    "translated_text": "— Welcome back.\nI&#x27;ve heard about Leo—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:10:30.114776",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:10:30.120835",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 349,
    "speaker": "Klaus",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::350": {
    "id": "139.csv::350",
    "source_text": "本当に、レオらしいっていうか、あはは――\nうん――大変だったね",
    "translated_text": "Really, it&#x27;s so like Leo, or rather, ahaha—\nYeah— that was tough, wasn&#x27;t it",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:10:52.234265",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:10:52.241647",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 350,
    "speaker": "Klaus",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::351": {
    "id": "139.csv::351",
    "source_text": "聞いたぞ\n黒騎士はもういない",
    "translated_text": "I heard. The Black Knight is gone.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:11:27.506657",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:11:27.513346",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 351,
    "speaker": "Gerd",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::352": {
    "id": "139.csv::352",
    "source_text": "払った代償を嘆くより、強敵がいなくなったこと――\nまず、その喜びを分かち合おうではないか",
    "translated_text": "Rather than lament the price paid, the formidable foe is no more—first, let us share that joy.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:13:13.115701",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:13:13.122110",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 352,
    "speaker": "Gerd",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::353": {
    "id": "139.csv::353",
    "source_text": "黒騎士が消えてもなお\nレスタニアへの悪意は腐臭のごとく漂っている",
    "translated_text": "Though the Black Knight be vanished, malice toward Lestania doth linger still, like the stench of decay.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:13:31.370969",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:13:31.377821",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 353,
    "speaker": "The White Dragon",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "139.csv::354": {
    "id": "139.csv::354",
    "source_text": "覚者よ――\n悪意の原泉はレスタニアの外にある\nその正体、しかと見極めよ",
    "translated_text": "Arisen—\nThe wellspring of malice lies beyond Lestania.\nDiscern thou its true nature.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:14:56.821067",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T16:14:56.828976",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\139.csv",
    "row_index": 354,
    "speaker": "The White Dragon",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  }
}